    <string name="app_health_privacy_title">How Hermes uses your health data</string>
    <string name="app_health_privacy_what">When you turn on health sharing in Settings › Phone data › Health, this app reads the categories you choose from Health Connect: hourly and daily summaries, each night\'s sleep and each workout, and individual readings only where you turn them on. It only reads; it never writes to Health Connect.</string>
    <string name="app_health_privacy_where">It sends them straight to the Hermes profile and host you chose, sealed end to end. They never go through the notification relay, and the app\'s developer can\'t see them.</string>
    <string name="app_health_privacy_reads">Your agent reads them when you ask, or when a task needs them. Whatever it reads goes to the AI model provider your Hermes uses, under that provider\'s terms. If your Hermes is hosted by someone else, they can read it too.</string>
    <string name="app_health_privacy_never">Health data is never used for advertising, never sold, and never shared with anyone but the Hermes you chose.</string>
    <string name="app_health_privacy_stop">You can turn sharing off at any time in Settings › Phone data › Health and delete what was sent from the host, and take back Health Connect access in Android\'s settings.</string>
    <string name="app_health_privacy_close">Close</string>
